      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\nDay 12, Wednesday 8th October, 2025\nProvision of Engineering Infrastucture to Outstanding Layouts within Guzape A09 Lots and I district and AlT\nNeighborhood in Asokoro A04 District\n\nFCT motorists are hereby informed that traffic along the Guzape area by SARS, towards the NNPC Filling Station, will be slightly affected as dignitaries will be heading towards the Sir Steve Nwadiuko Street, in Guzape.\n\nTraffic and security personnel will be deployed accordingly by 0800hrs to ensure seamless traffic flow.\nYour cooperation is still highly solicited.\n\n- Head Traffic DRTS.",
